## Adding New Features Checklist

1. Add query key to `lib/constants/query-keys.ts` (use hierarchical structure: `domain.scope.detail`)
2. Create API functions in `lib/api/[feature].ts` (use `apiFetch` base client)
3. Create query options in `lib/query-options/[feature].ts` (normalize filters if applicable)
4. Create hooks in `lib/hooks/use-[feature].ts` (export from `lib/hooks/index.ts`)
5. Create Zod schemas in `lib/validations/[feature].ts` (export types with `z.infer`)
6. Create service functions in `lib/services/[feature].ts` (use `getMemberWithPermissions()` for permission checks)
7. Plan invalidation strategy (simple, cascading, or optimistic - see Mutation Invalidation Strategies above)
8. For forms: Follow form patterns above, use react-hook-form + Zod, pass `control` prop to children
9. For server pages: Prefetch queries with `Promise.all()` and wrap with `HydrationBoundary`
